  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO-designated sites for the sustainable management of ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will support the consolidation and development of the subregional BR networks in Southeast Asia encompassing the majority of member states in the sub-region, along with the expanding regional network of UNESCO Global Geoparks. Particular emphasis will be placed on enabling the region&apos;s MAB Community and Biosphere Reserves sites to fully implement the final four years of the MAB Strategy (2022-2025), to serve the UNESCO-designated sites for the localization of the SDGs, connecting the global goals with UN Sustainable Development Cooperation Frameworks and in-situ implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
